---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout lang="en" title="Skills — Ilian Simeonow"  description="Ilian Simeonow's full range of stunt and acrobatic skills: fencing, high falls, Globe of Speed, fight choreography and more." heroImage="/images/stunt/Fechten-1.jpg">

  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="hero-top-bar"></div>
    <div class="page-hero-content">
      <div class="section-label">// Skills</div>
      <h1 class="page-hero-title">Skills &amp;<br /><span style="color: var(--orange);">Disciplines</span></h1>
      <p class="page-hero-sub">Stunt · Acrobatics · Equipment</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="intro-section">
    <div class="section-label">// Profile</div>
    <h2 class="section-heading">Stunts, Acrobatics<br />&amp; More.</h2>
    <p class="body-text" style="max-width: 680px;">
      After a 5½-year training at the State Ballet School Berlin, Ilian specialised as a trampoline stunt performer — the direct descendant of the circus artists who invented the stunt profession. Today he commands a broad range of stunt, acrobatic and combat skills.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="skills-full-section">
    <div class="skills-full-grid">
      <div class="skills-full-cat">
        <div class="skills-full-cat-header">
          <div class="section-label">// 01</div>
          <h3 class="skills-full-cat-title">Acrobatics / X-treme Artistry</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="skills-full-list">
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Trampoline</strong><span>Certified artist · trampoline stunt performer · foundation of stunt training</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Teeterboard</strong><span>Acrobatic teeterboard for partner numbers and stunts</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Floor Acrobatics</strong><span>Handstand, somersaults, back flips — full gymnastic training</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Juggling</strong><span>Balls, clubs, rings — show and stage juggling</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Close-Up / Stand-Up</strong><span>Close-up magic, audience numbers, stage comedy</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Magic &amp; Illusion</strong><span>Stage magic, illusion acts, hosting</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>High Diving</strong><span>High-diving stunts from the platform</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Equilibristics</strong><span>Balance artistry — balancing on unstable surfaces</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Globe of Speed</strong><span>Motorcycle Globe of Speed — solo and group act</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Wheel of Death</strong><span>Large rotating acrobatic apparatus — solo show and duet</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Fire Breathing / Eating</strong><span>Fire show for stage, open air and film</span></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="skills-full-cat">
        <div class="skills-full-cat-header">
          <div class="section-label">// 02</div>
          <h3 class="skills-full-cat-title">Stunt</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="skills-full-list">
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Show Choreography</strong><span>Concept and coordination of fight scenes for film and stage</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Fencing &amp; Sword Fighting</strong><span>Foil, sabre, longsword — for film, theatre and show</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Body Stunt</strong><span>Stair falls, slides, car-over rolls, bicycle falls</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>High Fall</strong><span>Falls from height — buildings, staircases, vehicles</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Horse Riding (Stunt Riding)</strong><span>Gallop riding, stunt sequences on horseback, Western and historical riding</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Martial Arts</strong><span>Tae Kwon Do · Capoeira · Filipino · Judo · Thai/Kickboxing · Boxing · Modern Arnis</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Firearms Training</strong><span>Incl. muzzle-loading pistols, rifles and cannons (black powder)</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Abseiling</strong><span>Industrial climbing, rappelling, vertical stunts</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Fight Scenes of All Kinds</strong><span>Film and stage combat, stage combat, stunts with actors</span></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="skills-full-cat">
        <div class="skills-full-cat-header">
          <div class="section-label">// 03</div>
          <h3 class="skills-full-cat-title">Own Equipment</h3>
        </div>
        <ul class="skills-full-list">
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Mats</strong><span>Various sizes and thicknesses for stunts and training</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Abseiling Equipment</strong><span>Complete kit for vertical stunts</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Foils &amp; Swords</strong><span>Various fencing equipment for film, theatre and show</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Police Uniform NRW</strong><span>Authentic uniform for film and TV</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Medieval Costume</strong><span>Complete knight and medieval costume</span></div></li>
          <li><span class="skill-dot-lg"></span><div><strong>Western Costume</strong><span>Authentic Western outfit for Karl-May and Western productions</span></div></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact-section">
    <div>
      <div class="section-label">// Booking</div>
      <div class="contact-heading">Interested?<br />Get in touch.</div>
      <div class="contact-actions">
        <a href="/en/contact/" class="btn-primary">Send Enquiry</a>
        <a href="/pdfs/setcard-en.pdf" download class="btn-ghost">↓ Sedcard PDF</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-info">
      <div class="contact-detail"><strong>Phone</strong>+49 (0)176 / 303 101 42</div>
      <div class="contact-detail"><strong>E-Mail</strong>actionartist@web.de</div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
.page-hero { min-height: 45vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: flex-end; padding: 80px var(--page-pad) 56px; position: relative; background: linear-gradient(175deg, #0e0e0e 0%, #1c0c04 55%, #0e0e0e 100%); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
.page-hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
.page-hero-title { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 96px); font-weight: bold; line-height: 0.9; letter-spacing: -2px; color: var(--white); margin-bottom: 20px; }
.page-hero-sub { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--gray); }
.intro-section { padding: 64px var(--page-pad) 48px; background: var(--black); border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
.skills-full-section { padding: 0 var(--page-pad) var(--section-pad); background: var(--black); }
.skills-full-grid { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.skills-full-cat { background: var(--black); padding: 48px 0; }
.skills-full-cat + .skills-full-cat { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); padding-top: 48px; }
.skills-full-cat-header { margin-bottom: 32px; }
.skills-full-cat-title { font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(28px, 3vw, 40px); color: var(--white); font-weight: bold; margin-top: 8px; }
.skills-full-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: var(--border); }
.skills-full-list li { background: var(--card); padding: 20px 24px; display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start; }
.skill-dot-lg { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--orange); flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 7px; }
.skills-full-list li strong { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 14px; color: var(--white); font-weight: 600; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
.skills-full-list li span { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 12px; color: var(--gray); line-height: 1.5; display: block; }
</style>
